.TH MINTTOYS-SETTINGS 1 2026-10-02 "MintToys" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
minttoys-settings \- set up MintToys' tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B minttoys-settings
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B minttoys-settings
opens the MintToys window, where each tool is switched on or off and set up: for Awake,
what a click on the panel icon starts, and whether the screen stays on. Starting it again
brings the open window to the front.
.PP
The settings are kept by the MintToys service of the session, which starts on its own if
it is not running yet.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/minttoys/config.json
The settings, one section per module.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR minttoys (1)
